 "trade": "entry at the next M5 bar open (long ask / short bid); stop 1.5 x Wilder ATR14 of mid M5 = 1R; breakeven after +1R (one-bar latency), 3R target, exit at the next open after an opposite M5 supertrend flip (ATR10, mult 3, mid), time exit after 12 bars; label = net R > 0 after bid/ask",
 "decision": "score at the close of a completed M5 bar i (bars <= i only); mid = (bid + ask) / 2 per OHLC field",
